Downloads and deploys the NGINX Ingress Controller manifests into your Kubernetes cluster use below command.
kubectl apply -f https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/ingress-nginx/controller-v1.2.1/deploy/static/provider/cloud/deploy.yaml


Clone the repo
https://github.com/mustafaprojectsindevops/kubernetes.git
kubectl apply -f .  // here deployment and svc  get created  // in service yml give clusterip type of service
so that ingress dns will connect to cluster IP and Ingress DNS expose our services  to internet based on routing

you will see DNS generated here :-kubectl get ing

Check for Ingress Pods (Across all namespaces)
kubectl get pods --all-namespaces | grep -i ingress

Check for Ingress Services
kubectl get svc --all-namespaces | grep -i ingress





